flowchart TD
  Markdown["Markdown + arbitrary frontmatter"]
  OtherArtifact["Media / code / EDN / diagram / other artifact"]
  External["GitHub / clock / tool / person / external event"]

  Adapter["Adapter preserves source as Clojure data"]
  Alpha["α Alpha validates asserted contracts"]
  Artifact["Validated Artifact + typed Relations"]
  Draft["EventDraft without runtime identity or time"]
  Materialize["Runtime / Clio materializes Event"]
  Event["Durable Event"]
  Clio["Clio append-only facts / causal history"]
  Select["Alpha selects declarative Reactions"]
  Condition{"Katamorph Condition holds?"}
  Invoke["Typed Operation / Workflow"]
  Outcome["Artifacts + contributions + receipts"]
  Projection["Π projections / views / products"]
  Finding["Structural finding; no silent pass"]

  Markdown --> Adapter
  OtherArtifact --> Adapter
  Adapter --> Alpha
  Alpha -->|valid| Artifact
  Alpha -->|invalid| Finding

  Artifact --> Draft
  Draft --> Materialize --> Event
  External --> Event
  Event --> Clio
  Artifact --> Select
  Event --> Select --> Condition
  Condition -->|no| Clio
  Condition -->|yes| Invoke
  Invoke --> Outcome
  Outcome --> Clio
  Outcome --> Projection
  Outcome --> Draft
